publicName: Wen Ding?
oneLiner: Estimates time to the next level from your current XP pace.
icon: icon.png

---

A HUD estimates how long until you level from the experience you are gaining now. After 5 minutes with no experience, the current pace clears. A quest turn-in updates the time remaining.

## Features

- Estimates how long the next level will take at your current pace.
- Experience from any source, including quests, updates the time left.
- After 5 minutes with no experience, the current pace clears.
- While you are idle, the estimate refreshes every 15 seconds.
- Leveling up keeps the pace you already earned.
- The panel shows how long each level took, and how long each 10% of that level took.
- Ctrl-click the bar to open its settings.
- The bar can be moved from Edit Mode.
- The default experience bar stays hidden.

## Commands

- `/wd` or `/wending` opens the panel.
- `/wd show`, `/wd hide`, and `/wd toggle` show or hide the HUD.
- `/wd status` prints the current pace.
- `/wd reset` restarts pace sampling.
- `/wd times` prints how long each level and each 10% took.
- `/wd times clear` wipes those times for this character.
